   "standard": "IEC 60204-1",
   "edition": "2016",
   "title": "Emergency stop devices at each operator control station",
   "paraphrase": "An emergency stop device must be readily accessible at every operator control station and at the other places the risk assessment requires (ISO 13850 4.1.1.1: easily accessible). In the scene: for every declared operator station there is an e-stop within the declared reach radius, with an unobstructed approach. Operator stations are declared zones, not a perception class. The edition year is assumed.",
